WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.811
"You think that mystery man wants to kidnap William?"

2
00:00:17.812 --> 00:00:21.015
Henry wasn't so sure about Cole's idea.

3
00:00:21.016 --> 00:00:24.260
"That kind of thing doesn't happen in Belltown."

4
00:00:24.261 --> 00:00:28.205
"Daisy said William's family is rich," Cole said.

5
00:00:28.206 --> 00:00:33.526
"Or maybe the mystery man is mad about something William's dad did as a senator.

6
00:00:33.527 --> 00:00:36.446
And that's why he wants to kidnap William!"

7
00:00:36.447 --> 00:00:41.031
Maggie looked excited. "This could be our biggest case yet!"

8
00:00:41.032 --> 00:00:46.265
"But what does kidnapping have to do with slashing tires?" Henry asked.

9
00:00:46.266 --> 00:00:53.703
"Maybe the mystery man was trying to distract everyone so he'd have a chance to nab William," said Cole.

10
00:00:53.704 --> 00:00:58.830
"Maybe." Henry thought for a second. Then he shook his head.

11
00:00:58.831 --> 00:01:01.930
"I'm still not sure I believe any of this.

12
00:01:01.931 --> 00:01:04.779
But Maggie is right about one thing.

13
00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:09.165
This case is much more serious than our usual cases.

14
00:01:09.166 --> 00:01:14.486
We should warn William right away. Then we need to tell Ms. Hernandez."

15
00:01:14.487 --> 00:01:18.637
Cole nodded. "Let's go find William."

16
00:01:18.638 --> 00:01:24.078
The Lemonade Detectives wandered through the crowd, but William was nowhere to be seen.

17
00:01:24.079 --> 00:01:29.153
Finally Maggie spotted him. He'd wandered off by himself into the woods.

18
00:01:29.154 --> 00:01:32.942
They jogged toward him.

19
00:01:32.943 --> 00:01:38.450
William saw them coming. "Oh, it's you," he said uneasily.

20
00:01:38.451 --> 00:01:41.415
"Did you come to knock over my bag again?"

21
00:01:41.416 --> 00:01:46.844
"No, we came to warn you that someone might be trying to kidnap you," Cole said.

22
00:01:46.845 --> 00:01:50.478
"Have you noticed that stranger with the dark glasses?"

23
00:01:50.479 --> 00:01:53.497
"He's been following you!" Maggie added.

24
00:01:53.498 --> 00:01:57.230
"We're afraid he wants to kidnap you for ransom."

25
00:01:57.231 --> 00:02:02.048
For a second William just stared at them. Then he started laughing.

26
00:02:02.049 --> 00:02:07.577
Henry was confused. That definitely wasn't the reaction he was expecting!

27
00:02:07.578 --> 00:02:10.641
"What's so funny?" he asked.

28
00:02:10.642 --> 00:02:14.973
William kept laughing. Then he turned and walked away.

29
00:02:14.974 --> 00:02:18.673
"Hold on a minute!" Maggie stomped after him.

30
00:02:18.674 --> 00:02:24.089
"We're trying to help you! The least you can do is tell us what's so funny!"

31
00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:30.691
"Okay." William finally stopped laughing. "You don't have to worry.

32
00:02:30.692 --> 00:02:33.494
That guy isn't trying to kidnap me."

33
00:02:33.495 --> 00:02:36.391
"How do you know?" Henry asked.

34
00:02:36.392 --> 00:02:40.150
For a second he thought William was going to walk away again.

35
00:02:40.151 --> 00:02:45.262
Then Maggie poked William in the shoulder. "Tell us!" she ordered.

36
00:02:45.263 --> 00:02:49.136
"While you're at it, tell us why you're here," Cole added.

37
00:02:49.137 --> 00:02:51.859
"We know you didn't want to come on this ride."

38
00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:56.171
William frowned. "I did want to come," he said.

39
00:02:56.172 --> 00:02:58.760
"Well, I wanted to come at first.

40
00:02:58.761 --> 00:03:02.646
I thought it would be a good way to meet people since I'm new around here."

41
00:03:02.647 --> 00:03:05.775
Henry nodded. "That makes sense.

42
00:03:05.776 --> 00:03:08.899
But you don't look like you're having much fun."

43
00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:11.893
"That's because of Chuck," William said.

44
00:03:11.894 --> 00:03:14.793
"Who's Chuck?" Maggie asked.

45
00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:19.775
"The guy with the dark glasses." William hesitated. "He's my . . ."

46
00:03:19.776 --> 00:03:22.542
"Your what?" Maggie prompted him.

47
00:03:22.543 --> 00:03:26.700
William sighed. "My bodyguard."

48
00:03:26.701 --> 00:03:29.364
"What?" Cole exclaimed.

49
00:03:29.365 --> 00:03:32.805
"My parents made him come with me," William said.

50
00:03:32.806 --> 00:03:36.777
"We're new here so they weren't sure if the trail ride was safe for me.

51
00:03:36.778 --> 00:03:41.069
I didn't want everyone to think I was some weird rich kid with a bodyguard.

52
00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:43.519
So I decided not to come at all.

53
00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:47.727
But then my parents wouldn't let me back out." He shrugged.

54
00:03:47.728 --> 00:03:50.704
"Chuck promised he'd try to blend in with the other riders.

55
00:03:50.705 --> 00:03:52.715
But it didn't really work."

56
00:03:52.716 --> 00:03:58.348
Maggie giggled. "Yeah. He sort of stands out in the crowd."

57
00:03:58.349 --> 00:04:02.766
That made the others laugh too. Even William smiled.

58
00:04:02.767 --> 00:04:07.343
Now Henry understood why Chuck had lied to them about being a reporter.

59
00:04:07.344 --> 00:04:10.038
He'd been trying to protect William.

60
00:04:10.039 --> 00:04:14.939
William suddenly looked nervous. "Are you guys going to tell everyone?"

61
00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:19.327
"No way," Cole said. "Your secret's safe with us."

62
00:04:19.328 --> 00:04:24.395
Maggie nodded. "You can trust us. We're professionals."

63
00:04:24.396 --> 00:04:27.445
"Professional what?" William asked.

64
00:04:27.446 --> 00:04:29.915
"Detectives," Henry said.

65
00:04:29.916 --> 00:04:34.586
"Which reminds me—we have to hurry if we want to solve this case!"

66
00:04:34.587 --> 00:04:40.217
"What case? We have no suspects!" Maggie reminded him.

67
00:04:40.218 --> 00:04:43.800
"Maybe we can interview everyone again," Cole said.

68
00:04:43.801 --> 00:04:47.444
"Someone must have seen something suspicious!"

69
00:04:47.445 --> 00:04:52.562
"What about those two kids who keep sneaking into the woods together?" William asked.

70
00:04:52.563 --> 00:04:54.954
"That seems kind of suspicious."

71
00:04:54.955 --> 00:04:58.109
"What two kids?" Henry asked.

72
00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:01.476
William shrugged. "I don't know who they are.

73
00:05:01.477 --> 00:05:05.135
Some teenage guy and girl wearing school T-shirts."

74
00:05:05.136 --> 00:05:10.286
"Hi, guys," Nathan said, walking over. "What's going on?"

75
00:05:10.287 --> 00:05:15.899
"We were just talking to William," Henry said. "William, this is Nathan."

76
00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:21.346
"Hi." Nathan was friendly to everyone. "Are you new in Belltown?"

77
00:05:21.347 --> 00:05:25.592
Henry left the two of them chatting and dragged his friends aside.

78
00:05:25.593 --> 00:05:29.673
"Who do you think William saw sneaking around?" he said.

79
00:05:29.674 --> 00:05:32.152
"Did we miss some suspects?"

80
00:05:32.153 --> 00:05:34.710
"Maybe." Maggie shrugged.

81
00:05:34.711 --> 00:05:38.750
"But it was probably just high school kids sneaking away to kiss."

82
00:05:38.751 --> 00:05:43.246
Just then Henry heard the sound of rustling leaves deeper in the woods.

83
00:05:43.247 --> 00:05:47.677
Cole heard it too. "What's that? A deer or something?"

84
00:05:47.678 --> 00:05:51.578
Henry saw a flash of bright red and gold through the trees.

85
00:05:51.579 --> 00:05:56.175
"No, it's a Valley High person—or people.

86
00:05:56.176 --> 00:06:00.743
Come on. This could be our last chance!"
